{"4918330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1 Bit Chaos", "steam_appid": 4918330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f6216e0cce2b531a84da8420743c9a2c.poster.avif?t=1786136306\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f6216e0cce2b531a84da8420743c9a2c.webm?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f6216e0cce2b531a84da8420743c9a2c.mp4?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Experience a 100% customizable cyber-retro visual journey with adjustable VHS, CRT, Old Film (Noise), and Retro effects that you can toggle whenever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Prepare for a relentless challenge against more than just zombies running blindly at you. Face complex support enemies with tactical goals that protect each other and grant area-of-effect (Aura) buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Dominate with a satisfyingly diverse arsenal backed by flawlessly calculated, precise ballistic systems tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Support your character and rule the map with companions featuring their own smart AI, unique pathfinding/tracking mechanics, and dedicated slot layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Spend your hard-earned XP to purchase randomized perk cards from the shop that dramatically modify your stats, pushing your character's power to its absolute peak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> From a simple slingshot to devastating heavy laser cannons, choose from a wide range of gear. Experiment with different weapon and pet synergies on every single run to forge your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Obliterate endless hordes of enemies to collect Experience (XP) Orbs. Each time you level up, choose from randomized perk cards to boost your damage, fire rate, or bullet count, turning your character into an unstoppable killing machine for that run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f302d5097d3e2cc6d19aac438b46a818.webp?t=1786136306\" width=20 height=20 /></span> The gold you gather across the map during battle never goes to waste. Return to the shop after dying to spend your savings, unlocking a variety of brand-new weapons or unique pets (companions) to aid you in your next fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.poster.avif?t=1786136306\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.webm?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.mp4?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a two-person team of graphic design graduates! 1 Bit Chaos is our debut passion project, bringing together our design vision and deep love for retro gaming. We developed this game completely independently, pouring immense love into every single pixel and animation :)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/f6216e0cce2b531a84da8420743c9a2c.poster.avif?t=178613630