ap during battle never goes to waste. Return to the shop after dying to spend your savings, unlocking a variety of brand-new weapons or unique pets (companions) to aid you in your next fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.poster.avif?t=1786136306\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.webm?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4918330/extras/d249c68858f412b827f8bf5dc0693068.mp4?t=1786136306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a two-person team of graphic design graduates! 1 Bit Chaos is our debut passion project, bringing together our design vision and deep love for retro gaming. We developed this game completely independently, pouring immense love into every single pixel and animation :)</p>", "short_description": "Trapped inside an old CRT TV, hundreds of ruthless creatures are rushing at you! Start praying to level up, power up with random cards, and die a lot. Spend your gold on new weapons and tiny companions, then try again. Death has never been this profitable!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.s